# The GitHub login to look up on gitranks.com -- one line, nothing else.
# The same file gates the punch card and year graph views, which scan
# nothing without it.
#
# Copy this to ~/.config/claude-ipixel/github-user.txt and put your own in it:
#
#     mkdir -p ~/.config/claude-ipixel
#     echo YOURLOGIN > ~/.config/claude-ipixel/github-user.txt
#
# With no such file the gitranks, punch card and year graph views are
# switched off and no browser is ever started. gitranks.com sits behind a
# Cloudflare challenge, so the page is rendered in a headless Firefox
# (through geckodriver) at most once a day and cached in
# ~/.cache/claude-ipixel afterwards.
#
# Blank lines and everything after a # are ignored.

AmmarkoV
